## How seasons work

Seasons in Marathon run for roughly three months and introduce new content and features each cycle.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} At the start of every season players have a clean slate: gear, contract progress, faction progress, and player level are reset.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Persistent elements that carry across seasons include cosmetics, titles, Codex progression, and liaison contract progress.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Seasonal releases add new gameplay items and systems—such as weapons, Runner shells, zones, events, and other content—that are available to all players without paid expansions.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}}

## Season 1 and Season 2

Season 1, named Death Is The First Step, introduced the derelict UESC Marathon and the Perimeter region on Tau Ceti IV.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Ranked mode was rolled out in Season 1 as a beta, with its initial weekend availability in March limited to the Low Stakes pool.{{cite:bungie-ranked}} Season 2 launched on June 2, 2026 and opened with an Open Play Week spanning June 2–9.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}} The season added Night Marsh, the defensive Sentinel shell, the Cradle customization system for shells, and a selection of new weapons.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}} Midway through Season 2, the Vault Breaker experimental PvE roguelite mode was introduced inside Cryo Archive, going live on July 21.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}}

## Nightfall Refresh and Symbiosis roadmap

The Nightfall Refresh, announced in October, restructured progression, rewards, and aspects of the live experience.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} That update also added a no-cost NuCal-themed Reward Pass for Marathon owners and returned Sponsored Queues on a regular weekend schedule.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} Bungie announced that Symbiosis, scheduled for December, will add Marathon’s first ongoing PvE-focused experience, expand the Perimeter with new areas and ecosystems, introduce a new Runner shell, improve onboarding, and provide a social hub with activities like a firing range.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}}{{cite:bungie-press-symbiosis}} Symbiosis is set to go live on December 8 and includes an Open Play Week from December 8 through December 15, with limited Crew Up rewards available through December 22.{{cite:bungie-press-symbiosis}}

## Experimental queues and future plans

Experimental queues began in Season 1 and have included tests such as Duos and Sponsored Queue events.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Season 2 added a Duos queue with a daily rotating map schedule and continued to evaluate experimental modes.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}} Vault Breaker and other experimental playlists were also part of Season 2’s mid-season updates.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}}

