## Archetype

Destroyer is described as a combat specialist archetype.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Abilities

Destroyer shells are armed with a personal defense barricade.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Destroyer shells include missile systems as part of their kit.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Destroyer shells are equipped with movement thrusters.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Notable changes

The Riot Barricade ability received double-tap protection to prevent accidental deactivation (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Cosmetics and media

A Destroyer skin named Arata Vectus is listed among Symbiosis launch cosmetics.{{cite:bungie-symbiosis-open-play}} Bungie published a Destroyer Shell cinematic as part of Season 2 shell cinematics.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}} A Destroyer Runner Shell Style was included in Season 1 Ranked rewards listing.{{cite:bungie-ranked}}

