## Archetype

Assassin is classified as a Shadow agent Runner shell.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Core abilities

Assassin shells deploy synthetic smoke for concealment.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Assassin shells use camouflage technology to enable unseen strikes or cover during engagements.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Assassin's Prime ability is Smoke Screen.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Assassin's Tactical ability is Active Camo.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Assassin has a Shadow Dive trait listed as Trait 1.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Assassin has Shroud listed as Trait 2.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}}

## Notable changes and tuning

Season 2 restructured implants to grant a single fixed perk and a fixed stat package.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Season 2 added new implant perks such as Going Dark that make players invisible while using healing consumables.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Update 1.1.9.2 changed invisibility so it can flicker after 0.2 seconds instead of 0.9 seconds (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Media and coverage

Bungie published a Shell Cinematic for the Assassin shell.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}}

