## Archetype

Recon is described as an intel specialist Runner shell.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Recon is designed to identify threats and track movement.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Abilities

Recon’s Prime ability is Echo Pulse.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Recon’s Tactical ability is Tracker Drone.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Recon uses holographic footstep trails as part of its kit.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Recon has the Interrogation trait.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Recon has the Stalker Protocol trait.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}}

## Notable changes

Bungie reduced Echo Pulse’s omnidirectional ease to require three-dimensional prediction from Recon players (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Bungie stated Echo Pulse changes make the ability less oppressive and mandatory in team fights.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}}

