## Overview

Recon is an intel-focused Runner shell.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} It is designed to help players locate threats and follow enemy movement using tools such as echo-based scanning, deployable tracker drones, and visualized footstep paths.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}}

## Abilities

Echo Pulse now emits its pulses within a cone aligned to the player’s aim rather than radiating outward in all directions (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} When successful on first hit, Echo Pulse also staggers non-Runner foes and briefly blocks their combat abilities.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Traits

Interrogation’s alert that notifies pinged Recon players has been given a two-second delay, providing the player who applied the ping a short reaction window.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Notable Changes

Bungie described the October 6, 2026 adjustments as making Echo Pulse less oppressive and less of an automatic pick in engagements.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} The development team explained that changing Echo Pulse to operate in a forward cone was intended to require Recon players to predict enemy positions in three-dimensional space rather than relying on a simple, omnidirectional reveal.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

