## Overview

Recon is an intel-focused Runner shell.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Recon is built to find threats and follow movement.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} The shell’s toolkit features echo-based scans, deployable tracker drones, and holographic trails that reveal footsteps.{{cite:bungie-runner-shells}} Recon’s Prime ability is Echo Pulse.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Its Tactical ability is Tracker Drone.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}} Recon possesses the Interrogation trait and the Stalker Protocol trait.{{cite:pcgamer-guide}}

## Abilities

Echo Pulse was changed to emit pulses within a forward cone aligned to the player’s aim (Update 1.1.9.2, October 6, 2026).{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} On its first hit, Echo Pulse now staggers non-Runner enemy combatants and temporarily prevents them from using combat abilities.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Traits

Interrogation was adjusted so that the alert sent to pinged Recon players occurs after a two-second delay.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

## Notable Changes

Bungie described the October 6, 2026 adjustments as making Echo Pulse less oppressive and less mandatory in encounters.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} The developers explained that restricting Echo Pulse to a cone requires Recon players to predict target positions in three-dimensional space.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}}

