## Overview

Sentinel is a defensive-oriented Runner shell designed to establish and hold controlled zones of the battlefield.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} The shell was added at the launch of Season 2.{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}}

## Abilities and Trait

Defender System is Sentinel’s Prime ability and places an automated defensive platform that intercepts incoming explosive projectiles while improving nearby allies' weapon handling.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}} Snare Mine is the shell’s Tactical and is a thrown proximity mine that explodes into multiple Immobilizing submunitions.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Prey Tracker is a Trait that turns on limited forward motion tracking to reveal moving enemies on the HUD within a conical area.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Castle Doctrine is Sentinel’s passive, granting quicker ready and reload speeds for SMGs, Pistols, and Shotguns when hostiles are nearby, plus increased resistances following splash damage.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}

## Runner Cores and Perks

Season 2 introduced ten Sentinel-specific Runner cores across rarity tiers.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Reversal (Enhanced) restores health over time after the player defeats an immobilized enemy.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Wellness Beacon (Deluxe) speeds up the use of medical items for players standing near a deployed Defender System.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}} Eminent Domain (Prestige) causes Runner grenades that a Defender System stops to drop as lootable items on the ground.{{cite:bungie-s2-combat-tuning}}

## Notable Changes and Fixes

A mid-season update in July reaffirmed Sentinel’s role in Season 2 while covering broader sandbox and balance adjustments.{{cite:bungie-press-mid-season-2}} Patch 1.1.9.2 (October 6, 2026) resolved a bug that could cause certain grenades to become lodged when they struck surfaces within the area protected by an ally’s Defender System.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-9-2}} Patch 1.1.0.1 (June 9, 2026) corrected an issue preventing completion of the Sentinel challenge “Information Economy” after its requirements had been met.{{cite:bungie-update-1-1-0-1}}

