## Surface Zones

Marathon includes three planet-surface zones: Perimeter, Dire Marsh, and Outpost.{{cite:bungie-vidoc}}

## Perimeter and Dire Marsh

Perimeter is located on the colony’s outer edges and is presented as the easiest map for new Runners.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Dire Marsh is centered on a disaster site with a dominant central complex and emphasizes direct, action‑oriented encounters.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Both Perimeter and Dire Marsh were available to play during the Marathon Server Slam event.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}}

## Outpost

Outpost is portrayed as a UESC military compound organized around a tall, vertical structure known as the Pinwheel.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Bungie stated that Outpost becomes available one day after launch and requires players to reach Runner Level 12 before they can access it.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}}

## Cryo Archive (End‑Game)

Cryo Archive is the game’s end‑game location aboard the derelict UESC Marathon and is built around vault puzzles and multi‑layered mechanics.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}}{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} The zone runs across interconnected wings and contains multiple Vaults that demand specific keys and unique entry challenges to open.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} Bungie designed Cryo Archive for three‑player crews, scheduled it to open on weekends starting March 20, and set entry requirements of Runner Level 25, having all six factions unlocked, and a minimum Loadout Value of 5,000 credits.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}}

## Unlocking Zones and Expedition Access

Seasonal progression raises a player’s baseline power and gates access to tougher activities such as Cryo Archive.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Perimeter, Night Marsh, Outpost, and Cryo Archive are selectable for Expedition runs once a player has unlocked them by advancing their Runner Level.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} Players who reached and finished Dire Marsh in the prior season begin Season 2 with both Dire Marsh and Night Marsh unlocked; otherwise, the Marsh maps become available at Runner Level 3.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

