## Surface Zones

Marathon's planet-side content comprises three playable maps set on Tau Ceti IV: Perimeter, Dire Marsh, and Outpost.{{cite:bungie-vidoc}}

## Perimeter and Dire Marsh

Perimeter is positioned on the colony's outer edges and is presented as the more approachable map for new Runners.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Dire Marsh is framed around a disaster locus featuring a central complex and emphasizes direct combat.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} Both Perimeter and Dire Marsh were available to play during the Marathon Server Slam preview event.{{cite:bungie-server-slam}}

## Outpost

Outpost represents a UESC military site organized around a tall, multi‑level structure known as the Pinwheel.{{cite:gamesradar-maps}} The zone becomes available the day after launch and requires a Runner to reach Level 12 before entering.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Outpost cycles periodic environmental hazards called Heat Cascades and hides higher‑value rewards behind security card locks for access to the Pinwheel interior.{{cite:pcgamer-review}}

## Cryo Archive (End‑Game)

Cryo Archive is the Marathon ship's first end‑game deck, composed of interconnected wings, cryopods, medical areas, and secured Vaults that pair puzzle elements with layered mechanics.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}}{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} To enter Cryo Archive players must meet a set of requirements: reach Runner Level 25, unlock all six factions via liaison contracts, and equip a Loadout Value of at least 5,000 credits.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} Eligible players receive a single Cryo Archive Sponsored Kit from the Armory to help with initial attempts.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} The activity is designed for three‑person crews and opens on weekends, with Bungie announcing a March 20 availability window for the first unlock.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}}

## Unlocking Zones and Expedition Access

Seasonal progression raises the game's baseline power and restricts access to higher‑difficulty zones until players grow their character strength.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} For Expedition mode, the selectable locations include Perimeter, Night Marsh, Outpost, and Cryo Archive, but each must be unlocked by increasing Runner Level before they can be chosen.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} If a player unlocked and completed Dire Marsh in an earlier season, they begin Season 2 with access to both Dire Marsh and its nighttime counterpart; otherwise the two Marsh variants become available upon reaching Runner Level 3.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

