## Overview

Expedition is a new roguelite-style, player-vs-environment cooperative mode introduced in Symbiosis Phase 1.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} It uses its own matchmaking queue and is playable in solo, two-player, or three-player crews on Perimeter and Night Marsh, plus Outpost and Cryo Archive.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} PvP interactions are disabled for Expedition sessions so teams face only PvE encounters.{{cite:bungie-press-symbiosis}}

## Run Series

A typical Expedition session is structured as a Run Series made up of three consecutive runs that grow more challenging as the series progresses.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} The final run is called the Critical Incident and permits players to raise difficulty for improved rewards.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} After finishing a Run Series, crews may cash out or roll their completed series into a fresh one to continue advancing.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}}

## Buildcrafting, Flash Boosts, and Run Kits

Phase 1 adds an in-run upgrade system named Flash Boosts that lets crews shape and evolve builds while a Run Series is active.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} Flash Boosts are obtained from exploration, defeating formidable enemies, and completing objectives; stacking duplicates increases their rarity and effectiveness.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} Each faction supplies a locked starting loadout for a Run Series that players can augment by looting or upgrading gear during runs, and faction upgrades unlock over time to improve those baseline kits.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}} Flash Boosts and other items collected during runs are converted to credits when a Run Series ends, while earned credits and XP remain persistent.{{cite:bungie-expedition-phase-1}}

## Release and Events

An Open Play Week ran from December 8 to December 15, 2026, permitting all players to try Expedition and other Symbiosis content at no cost during that interval.{{cite:bungie-symbiosis-open-play}} The Crew Up event ran from December 8 through December 22 and incorporated Expedition challenges that rewarded cooperative progression and cosmetics.{{cite:bungie-symbiosis-open-play}}{{cite:bungie-press-symbiosis}}

