## What seasonal resets wipe
Seasonal wipes return every player to a fresh starting point by removing equipped items, active contract advancement, unlocked faction upgrade progress, and their current Runner level.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Season endings also clear contents placed in the Vault and revoke any personalized Armory configurations.{{cite:bungie-welcome-season-2}}

## What carries over between seasons
Players keep their earned achievements, purchased and unlocked cosmetics, earned titles, and other season reward items across season boundaries.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Progress recorded in the Codex is persistent and does not get cleared during seasonal resets.{{cite:bungie-cryo-archive}} Progress on liaison contracts and access to factions already unlocked remain available when a new season begins.{{cite:bungie-introducing-seasons}} Any Cryo Archive Subroutines obtained during Season 1 remain available after Season 1 ends and are usable in Season 2.{{cite:bungie-season-2-live}}

## October 2026 Nightfall Refresh
The Nightfall Refresh went live on October 6, 2026 as the first milestone toward the team’s longer-term roadmap goals.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}} That update performed a wide reset of player progression and the in-game economy, returning Cradle enhancements and faction aftermarket upgrades to their default state.{{cite:bungie-nightfall-refresh}}

